Development and Technical Explanation
1. Project Overview
AI-FAO-Assistant is an AI-powered agricultural assistant designed to provide farmers and agricultural users with useful information about:

Crops

Crop management

Irrigation

Soil management

Pests and diseases

Agricultural practices

Weather information

Agricultural knowledge

FAO-related documents and resources

Farmer-specific information

The system combines a Large Language Model (LLM), Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), agricultural knowledge, databases, and external APIs.

2. Main Objectives
The main objectives are:

Provide agriculture-related answers using natural language.

Retrieve reliable agricultural information before generating answers.

Maintain farmer and farm information.

Support multiple languages.

Support future crop and disease image analysis.

Integrate weather and agricultural data.

Provide source information for knowledge-based answers.

Protect user data.

Create an architecture that can scale from an MVP to a production system.

