26. Multilingual Architecture
The assistant should support:

English
Tamil
Hindi
Telugu
Kannada
Malayalam
Bengali
Marathi
etc.

The request contains:

{
    "question": "நெல் பயிருக்கு எவ்வளவு தண்ணீர் தேவை?",
    "language": "ta"
}

The AI service receives:

Language: ta

and generates the response in the requested language.

For production, language detection and translation should be separate services or controlled model operations rather than relying only on the user-provided language field.

